2}\n$$\n\nThis is in the form $ \\frac{\\sqrt{m}}{n} $ with $ m = 19 $ and $ n = 2 $, and since 19 and 2 are relatively prime, the final answer is:\n\n$$\n\\boxed{21}\n$$\n\n\\confidence{Almost certain}",
